What this license covers
========================

The MIT License below covers Peacefree Revival's own work: everything in this repository except
the game (decompiled/, src/, air/icons/ and docs/images/, below) and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt,
which holds other people's license texts.

It does not cover the game. Peacefree: Tactical Warfare is (c) 2014 Adventure Cat, LLC, all
rights reserved: its code (decompiled/, and the edited copies of its classes in src/), its art,
sound and music (the icons in air/icons/ are made from its art, and docs/images/ holds screenshots
of it), and the game inside the release downloads. The parts of the game made by others (the
Starling Framework, its particle system extension, Adobe's AGALMiniAssembler, the Cuprum font
and Audionautix's music) are under their own licenses, listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt. The
Windows app's downloads also hold the AIR runtime, under Wipro's AIR SDK License Agreement.


